---
source: crates/daemon/tests/cli_help.rs
expression: stdout
---
Store a key read from stdin (never from an argument, so it stays out of shell history and process listings)

Usage: mxr llm key set [OPTIONS] <PROVIDER>

Arguments:
  <PROVIDER>  [possible values: anthropic, openrouter]

Options:
      --dry-run          Check the key and show what would be stored, without storing it
      --format <FORMAT>  [possible values: table, json, jsonl, csv, ids]
  -h, --help             Print help
